== ui_card "Form Helpers"
  p.sp-text-muted <code>ui_text_field(name, value, url:, **options)</code>

  h3 Philosophy
  p Slim-Pickins focuses on <strong>Inline Editing</strong> as a primary data interaction pattern. Instead of heavy modal forms, we encourage editing data right where it lives.
  ul
    li <strong>Seamless:</strong> Click-to-edit interactions feel lightweight.
    li <strong>Progressive:</strong> Look like text, act like an input.
    li <strong>AJAX-Ready:</strong> Built-in Stimulus controllers handle the save-on-blur lifecycle.

  h3 Arguments
  == ui_table ["Name", "Type", "Description"],
    [["name", "String", "The form field name (used in the POST request)."],
     ["value", "String", "The current value to display."],
     ["url", "String", "The endpoint to POST changes to."],
     ["options", "Hash", "Additional attributes."]]

  h3 Real World Scenarios

  h4 1. Inline Rename
  p Allow a user to rename a resource instantly.

  .sp-card
    .sp-card__body
      == ui_text_field "project_name", "My Awesome Project", url: "#"

      == ui_code '== ui_text_field "project_name", "My Awesome Project", url: "/projects/1"'
